# Cursor Agent Rules

When asked to send notifications, dispatch deliverables, or read messages via Telegram:
- Use the `tg` (or `./bin/tg`) CLI tool.
- Sending documents/markdown: `tg send -f <file.md> -c "<caption>"`
- Sending quick status: `tg send "<message>"`
- Fetching incoming messages: `tg fetch --limit 5 --json`
- Chat ID retrieval: `tg chat-id --token "<token>"`
- Documentation & full guidelines: `.agents/skills/telegram/SKILL.md`
